  "solution": {
    "text": "Planes passing through line of intersection of the planes <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> is<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Since required plane is perpendicular to <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> hence<br /><math><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Hence, required plane is <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> i.e. <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
